                "message": "Leave in-progress compiler-cache files out of eviction\n\ncleanup_cache unlinked every cache entry, including a concurrent\nwriter's temporary file, so the writer's rename failed. Skip names\nending in .tmp, drop only day-old temps, and ignore a file that\ndisappears during the scan.",
